A comprehensive (X)Emacs interface for an embedded Common Lisp or
Scheme process.

To try it out, install one of the Lisp environments (lang/clisp for
instance), then in Emacs:

    M-x load-library ilisp RET
    M-x ilisp-mode RET

and select a dialect -- clisp-hs for clisp.  An interactive Lisp prompt
should appear.
